  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overseas Territories Border Security Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the Border Security Programme, OTs are supported to detect and respond to threats to their borders (physical, invisible and borderless) through the implementation of modern, robust customs and immigration systems, maritime security and cyber security, and have strong internal security processes, capacity and capability to counter cross-border threats to the OTs and the UK.  These focal areas are outlined in Pillars 2 and 3 of the Integrated Review Refresh 2023.  Additionally, the Programme contributes towards the National Strategy for Maritime Security 2022 under strategic objective &#x2018;Protecting our homeland &#x2013; work to ensure the security of our borders, ports and maritime infrastructure with Devolved Administrations, Overseas Territories and Crown Dependencies&#x2019;.</narrative>
  </description>
